Troubleshooting Tips
Common Issues and Solutions
Issue: Grafana service fails to start Solution: Check the logs for detailed error information:

sudo journalctl -u grafana-server -f
Issue: Cannot access Grafana web interface Solution: Verify the service is running and check firewall settings:

sudo systemctl status grafana-server
sudo ufw status
Issue: Forgot admin password Solution: Reset the admin password using the CLI:

sudo grafana-cli admin reset-admin-password newpassword
Issue: Port 3000 already in use Solution: Check what's using the port and stop it, or configure Grafana to use a different port by editing /etc/grafana/grafana.ini

